%!PS
% gs-render.ps — the 15-07 render-smoke fixture (D-11): a few drawing
% operators over plain geometry, nothing else.  Deliberately free of
% every kind of typeface machinery — the FILE output device needs none
% for this proof, and the licensing boundary keeps all such payloads
% out of every staged image (DESK-03 bitmap sets only).  Rendered by
% the donor venue harness as: gs -sDEVICE=ppmraw -sOutputFile=...
<< /PageSize [120 120] >> setpagedevice
0.5 setgray
newpath
20 20 moveto
100 20 lineto
100 100 lineto
20 100 lineto
closepath
fill
0 0 0 setrgbcolor
2 setlinewidth
newpath
60 60 36 0 360 arc
stroke
0.75 setgray
1 setlinewidth
newpath
20 104 moveto
100 104 lineto
stroke
showpage
